<title>FRANCE: BNP hires 14 Cr Lyonnais market makers.</title>
<headline>BNP hires 14 Cr Lyonnais market makers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BNP Equities, the brokerage unit of Banque Nationale de Paris, has hired 14 market makers from rival bank Credit Lyonnais, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>Star market maker Chris Hipkins and thirteen other operators located in Paris, London, New-York and Frankfurt, specialising in European stocks, were said to have made the transfer.</p>
<p>A BNP spokesman said that &quot;a team of experienced market makers will join BNP in the coming months to strengthen its European shares activity.&quot;</p>
<p>Credit Lyonnais officials were not immediately available for comments.</p>
</text>
